a beanbag chair


00:38:10.208 --> 00:38:11.514
and some comic books.


00:38:13.037 --> 00:38:14.256
What happened here?


00:38:14.952 --> 00:38:16.127
[hard grunt]


00:38:16.302 --> 00:38:18.434
I'’m tired
of giving you warnings!


00:38:19.305 --> 00:38:21.307
[grunts, yells]


00:38:22.308 --> 00:38:23.700
Where'’d you go, hedgehog?


00:38:23.874 --> 00:38:25.746
I wasn'’t finished
trauma dumping.


00:38:27.574 --> 00:38:30.359
My darlings!


00:38:30.533 --> 00:38:32.056
[inhales, giggles]


00:38:32.230 --> 00:38:34.668
My eggy weggies!


00:38:35.799 --> 00:38:38.846
[professor] ♪ <i>Memories</i>♪


00:38:39.020 --> 00:38:42.371
♪ <i>Light the corners</i>♪


00:38:42.545 --> 00:38:46.201
♪ <i>Of my mind</i>♪


00:38:46.375 --> 00:38:49.509
♪ <i>Misty watercolor</i>♪


00:38:49.683 --> 00:38:55.297
♪ <i>Memories</i>♪


00:38:55.471 --> 00:38:58.344
♪ <i>Of the way</i>♪


00:38:58.518 --> 00:39:03.784
♪ <i>We weren'’t</i>♪


00:39:04.741 --> 00:39:05.742
I...


00:39:07.483 --> 00:39:09.224
don'’t believe it.Don'’t you?


00:39:09.398 --> 00:39:10.660
It'’s impossible.Is it?


00:39:10.834 --> 00:39:11.748
It couldn'’t be.Couldn'’t it?


00:39:11.922 --> 00:39:12.706
I'’m--Are you?


00:39:12.880 --> 00:39:14.055
Imposter!


00:39:14.229 --> 00:39:16.492
You stole my babies!


00:39:16.666 --> 00:39:19.843
But they know
who their real daddy is...


00:39:20.017 --> 00:39:21.105
drone-napper!


00:39:21.279 --> 00:39:22.803
[chortling]


00:39:22.977 --> 00:39:26.067
Magnificent creations,
my boy.


00:39:26.241 --> 00:39:28.809
I borrowed them
to lure you here


00:39:28.983 --> 00:39:30.985
