00:39:32.726 --> 00:39:34.380
You see, Ivo...


00:39:36.512 --> 00:39:39.515
I'’m your grandfather:


00:39:39.689 --> 00:39:42.126
Gerald Robotnik.


00:39:46.174 --> 00:39:48.872
My... grandfather?


00:39:50.613 --> 00:39:53.486
But how? And why?


00:39:54.269 --> 00:39:56.314
And who did what with whom?


00:39:56.489 --> 00:40:01.407
You hail from an ancestry
of excellence...


00:40:01.581 --> 00:40:04.148
tied directly <i>à moi.</i>


00:40:04.322 --> 00:40:07.238
Yes, I know French.


00:40:09.763 --> 00:40:11.286
You do look like me.


00:40:12.243 --> 00:40:14.202
But fatter. And older.


00:40:15.072 --> 00:40:17.031
And there'’s that funny smell.


00:40:18.728 --> 00:40:21.557
But the resemblance
is uncanny.


00:40:22.428 --> 00:40:24.038
It'’s as if...


00:40:24.212 --> 00:40:26.301
[both]
...we'’re two characters in a movie


00:40:26.475 --> 00:40:29.043
