by the same actor.


00:40:29.217 --> 00:40:31.654
But I need real proof!Ivo!


00:40:31.828 --> 00:40:33.134
We have very little time.


00:40:34.657 --> 00:40:36.790
But I could field
a couple of queries.


00:40:36.964 --> 00:40:40.097
Name the most elegant formula
in mathematics.


00:40:40.271 --> 00:40:41.621
Euler'’s Identity.


00:40:41.795 --> 00:40:44.101
E to the I times pi plus one
equals zilch.


00:40:44.275 --> 00:40:46.103
European capitals
arranged alphabetically


00:40:46.277 --> 00:40:47.540
by the fourth letter.


00:40:47.714 --> 00:40:49.455
Riga, Monaco, Sarajevo, Tirana.


00:40:49.629 --> 00:40:51.413
The speed of light
divided by the speed of sound,


00:40:51.587 --> 00:40:53.633
divided by
the speed of the bus in the movie <i>Speed.</i>


00:40:53.807 --> 00:40:55.156
[mimics adding machine]


00:40:55.330 --> 00:40:57.898
17,893.33333...


00:40:58.072 --> 00:41:01.510
Rounding up?17,894 MPH.


00:41:01.684 --> 00:41:04.165
And, for all the marbles...


00:41:04.339 --> 00:41:06.515
Good. I lost mine.


00:41:06.689 --> 00:41:08.735
A rare lung disease,


00:41:08.909 --> 00:41:11.999
and the longest word
in the English dictionary.


00:41:12.652 --> 00:41:14.131
Um...


00:41:14.305 --> 00:41:17.613
[both] Pneumonoultramicroscopic-
silicovolcanoconiosis!


00:41:18.484 --> 00:41:22.139
Pap-pap!In the saggy flesh.


00:41:22.313 --> 00:41:24.402
