for a hundred and ten.


00:41:24.577 --> 00:41:26.143
[shuddering grunt]


00:41:26.840 --> 00:41:29.451
Oh, Grampy-poo! [laughs]


00:41:32.846 --> 00:41:36.632
Where have you been
my entire life?


00:41:36.806 --> 00:41:38.373
[moans happily]


00:41:38.547 --> 00:41:40.549
