00:42:13.408 --> 00:42:15.062
Come on, kiddo.


00:42:23.461 --> 00:42:25.855
[groaning]


00:42:28.858 --> 00:42:30.817
Oh, no. Oh, no, no.


00:42:30.991 --> 00:42:32.819
Someone tell me
this is some kind of


00:42:32.993 --> 00:42:35.125
