You sicken me.


00:42:50.837 --> 00:42:53.230
You must be
the long-lost grandson.


00:42:53.404 --> 00:42:56.277
And you must be
another stinking hedgehog.


00:42:56.451 --> 00:42:58.496
So you'’re the one
behind all this.


00:42:58.671 --> 00:43:00.890
The Shadow breakout.The attack on Walters.


00:43:01.064 --> 00:43:02.239
That musty
old-man smell.


00:43:02.413 --> 00:43:04.372
How dare you insult me


00:43:04.546 --> 00:43:06.200
