exposition!


00:43:06.374 --> 00:43:08.463
Shadow, get the key.


00:43:08.637 --> 00:43:09.638
Where is it?


00:43:09.812 --> 00:43:11.901
Ha! Good one, Hot Topic.


00:43:12.075 --> 00:43:14.164
Do you really think
we'’d be that stupid


00:43:14.338 --> 00:43:16.384
