to take everything from them.


00:43:23.609 --> 00:43:24.871
[Gerald] With this.


00:43:25.045 --> 00:43:28.701
My masterpiece
of malevolence...


00:43:28.875 --> 00:43:31.399
The Eclipse Cannon.


00:43:31.573 --> 00:43:34.663
<i>In exchange</i>
<i>for my freedom,</i>


00:43:34.837 --> 00:43:36.970
<i>I gave GUN</i>
<i>the most powerful weapon</i>


00:43:37.144 --> 00:43:39.668
<i>mankind has ever seen,</i>


00:43:39.842 --> 00:43:42.410
<i>capable of delivering</i>
<i>a precision strike</i>


00:43:42.584 --> 00:43:43.977
<i>anywhere on Earth.</i>


00:43:45.413 --> 00:43:46.632
<i>Our first target:</i>


00:43:47.458 --> 00:43:49.112
<i>GUN Headquarters.</i>


00:43:49.286 --> 00:43:51.419
But firing a weapon
that powerful


00:43:51.593 --> 00:43:53.551
could threaten millions
of innocent lives!


00:43:53.726 --> 00:43:55.989
Yeah, tera-bite me.[cackles]


00:43:56.163 --> 00:44:01.037
This is one of two keys required
to launch the Eclipse Cannon.


00:44:01.211 --> 00:44:03.518
The other is locked
inside GUN headquarters.


00:44:03.692 --> 00:44:05.563
Once we have both,


00:44:05.738 --> 00:44:08.566
I will take rightful control
of my weapon.


00:44:08.741 --> 00:44:10.525
I'’m in.


00:44:17.488 --> 00:44:18.968
Holy crab!


00:44:19.142 --> 00:44:20.753
