this little adventure.


00:44:24.844 --> 00:44:27.020
It really worked out
for me.


00:44:27.194 --> 00:44:30.153
And you wonder why
I have trust issues!


00:44:31.633 --> 00:44:33.809
Shadow, wait! Don'’t do this.


00:44:33.983 --> 00:44:35.376
I know you'’re hurting,


00:44:35.550 --> 00:44:38.074
