one of my rings!


00:45:24.947 --> 00:45:26.166
[Sonic] Got one.


00:45:26.340 --> 00:45:28.559
Check this out. Trick shot!


00:45:28.734 --> 00:45:29.952
[grunts]


00:45:32.259 --> 00:45:33.739
Come on.


00:45:35.001 --> 00:45:36.567
Come on.


00:45:36.742 --> 00:45:38.395
Come on.[Knuckles groans]


00:45:40.006 --> 00:45:41.703
[both] Come on!


00:45:42.443 --> 00:45:43.357
[yells]


00:45:43.531 --> 00:45:45.707
[all yelling]


00:45:51.104 --> 00:45:53.628
Yeah! Yes!


00:45:57.327 --> 00:45:58.328
[Sonic] Yikes.


00:45:59.634 --> 00:46:01.418
Somebody better call
Google Maps.


00:46:02.593 --> 00:46:05.161
[rumbling faintly]


00:46:05.335 --> 00:46:09.470
I'’ve spent years
trying to cleanse the cosmos


00:46:09.644 --> 00:46:13.300
