00:46:22.744 --> 00:46:25.616
Charting route to GUN
Headquarters in London, sirs.


00:46:25.791 --> 00:46:27.880
ETA four hours.


00:46:28.054 --> 00:46:29.359
As the crab flies.


00:46:29.533 --> 00:46:31.884
By all accounts,
we'’re ahead of schedule.


00:46:32.841 --> 00:46:34.756
We should take this time


00:46:34.930 --> 00:46:36.932
