00:48:10.417 --> 00:48:13.420
[song resumes]


00:48:20.514 --> 00:48:21.994
[song ends]


00:48:31.525 --> 00:48:32.961
And done!


00:48:33.135 --> 00:48:35.877
Masterpiece.
Look at that.Yay!


00:48:36.051 --> 00:48:39.489
It'’s really been great
having time to ourselves.


00:48:39.663 --> 00:48:42.101
Right. Absolutely.
I just feel so...


00:48:42.275 --> 00:48:43.667
