Clearheaded.


00:48:43.841 --> 00:48:46.148
Mmm, look at all these
new interests we found.


00:48:46.322 --> 00:48:48.324
I know, so many hobbies.So many!


00:48:48.498 --> 00:48:51.327
After the action and adventure
of the last few years,


00:48:51.501 --> 00:48:53.721
well, I could get used to this.Same.


00:48:53.895 --> 00:48:55.897
[deep rumbling]


00:48:59.466 --> 00:49:01.816
[Sonic] Tom! Maddie!
We need your help on a super--


00:49:01.990 --> 00:49:04.819
Knuckles, do you mind?Oh! Excuse me.


00:49:04.993 --> 00:49:06.429
Tom! Maddie! We need your help


00:49:06.603 --> 00:49:08.127
