top-secret mission!


00:49:08.301 --> 00:49:09.345
Hmm.


00:49:11.086 --> 00:49:12.740
Thank God. Yeah, we'’re in.Let'’s go.


00:49:12.914 --> 00:49:15.134
Really? You'’re in?
Just like that?


00:49:15.308 --> 00:49:18.050
Yes. It was getting so boring
without you guys here.Yeah. So...


00:49:18.224 --> 00:49:19.877
No offense....boring. No, none taken.


00:49:20.052 --> 00:49:21.531
I mean, whatever crazy plan
you'’re cooking up,


00:49:21.705 --> 00:49:23.011
the answer'’s yes.Yes.


00:49:23.185 --> 00:49:26.145
Great. But first things first:
What is that?


00:49:26.319 --> 00:49:27.798
Oh! This is...


00:49:27.973 --> 00:49:29.409
[in puppet voice]
...Li'’l Tom!


00:49:29.583 --> 00:49:31.063
