Isn'’t he great?


00:49:32.629 --> 00:49:34.849
I told you
to get rid of that. It'’s very creepy.


00:49:35.023 --> 00:49:36.198
[puppet voice]
I told him to get rid of you.


00:49:36.372 --> 00:49:37.765
