Whoa!


01:02:52.689 --> 01:02:54.691
My feet. Why can'’t I
use my beautiful feet?


01:02:54.866 --> 01:02:56.345
Heh-heh![Rockwell] Because...


01:02:56.519 --> 01:02:59.566
this vault is armed
with variable gravity.


01:02:59.740 --> 01:03:00.959
[straining]


01:03:01.133 --> 01:03:01.960
No kidding.


01:03:02.134 --> 01:03:03.918
[Rockwell] Green goes up...


01:03:04.092 --> 01:03:06.268
and red takes you down... hard.


01:03:06.442 --> 01:03:07.617
Rockwell, listen to me.


01:03:07.792 --> 01:03:09.576
The Robotniks are planning to--
[yelps]


01:03:09.750 --> 01:03:11.665
Oh, they'’re planning on stealing
a second key, just like you are?


01:03:11.839 --> 01:03:13.232
Yes, I'’m aware.


01:03:14.755 --> 01:03:17.279
I called it
the second Commander Walters was attacked.


01:03:17.453 --> 01:03:18.933
So...


01:03:19.107 --> 01:03:21.675
thank you
for taking the bait


01:03:21.849 --> 01:03:23.329
and falling
right into my trap.


01:03:23.503 --> 01:03:25.635
I don'’t believe this.


01:03:25.810 --> 01:03:27.420
[Gerald]
I know, grandson.


01:03:27.594 --> 01:03:29.596
A woman in the military!


01:03:31.511 --> 01:03:32.947
Let'’s go.


01:03:34.035 --> 01:03:35.254
Go, positions!


01:03:35.428 --> 01:03:36.516
Full perimeter.


01:03:36.690 --> 01:03:37.909
[weapons powering up]


01:03:38.083 --> 01:03:39.388
Robotnik.


01:03:39.562 --> 01:03:41.826
Going full spandex, huh?
Who'’s the fossil?


01:03:42.000 --> 01:03:46.134
That'’s my grandfather,
you dough-eating dimbecile.


01:03:46.308 --> 01:03:49.398
Who are they?A couple of bleeding hearts,


01:03:49.572 --> 01:03:52.401
here to rescue
their emotional-support animals.


01:03:52.575 --> 01:03:54.360
Enough! It'’s over.


01:03:54.534 --> 01:03:58.103
The only way
you'’re leaving here is in handcuffs.


01:03:58.277 --> 01:03:59.974
There is no other way out.


01:04:00.148 --> 01:04:02.934
You know, there might be
one other way out.


01:04:03.108 --> 01:04:04.500
And what is that
supposed to mean?


01:04:04.674 --> 01:04:06.589
[Sonic] Hey, big guy,
I think it'’s time to...


01:04:07.764 --> 01:04:11.072
Break glass
in case of emergency!


01:04:13.031 --> 01:04:15.076
[roaring]


01:04:15.947 --> 01:04:17.209
[grunts]


01:04:18.210 --> 01:04:21.256
Ha! Nothing can stop
Team Knuckles!


01:04:21.430 --> 01:04:22.518
Open fire!


01:04:23.519 --> 01:04:25.391
[yelps] Knuckles,
turn this stuff off!


01:04:25.565 --> 01:04:26.871
Hurry!On it.


01:04:28.481 --> 01:04:29.569
Uh-oh.


01:04:29.743 --> 01:04:31.701
[all yelling in surprise]


01:04:31.876 --> 01:04:33.878
[grunting]


01:04:37.185 --> 01:04:39.535
Ha! See how you like it--
[groans]


01:04:39.709 --> 01:04:41.711
[yelping]


01:04:43.278 --> 01:04:45.063
[both gasp]


01:04:45.237 --> 01:04:46.891
[all groaning]


01:04:47.065 --> 01:04:49.110
Can you move?No, not at all.


01:04:49.284 --> 01:04:51.721
Tails, can you?No, I'’m stuck.


01:04:51.896 --> 01:04:53.288
We might be here a while.


01:04:53.462 --> 01:04:55.464
[growls, grunts]


01:04:55.638 --> 01:04:57.902
Whoa! Whoa. Whoa. Whoa.


01:04:58.903 --> 01:05:00.339
Where'’s the key?


01:05:06.258 --> 01:05:07.476
Whoa!


01:05:07.650 --> 01:05:10.305
What was that?We might have a problem.


01:05:11.959 --> 01:05:13.918
[grunts] No, no, no, no!


01:05:15.093 --> 01:05:17.573
[grunting]


01:05:21.577 --> 01:05:23.188
[exclaims]


01:05:24.102 --> 01:05:25.190
[huffs]


01:05:34.634 --> 01:05:36.723
I'’m moving.


01:05:37.506 --> 01:05:39.117
I'’m moving!


01:05:42.294 --> 01:05:44.731
You go get it, grandson!


01:05:45.471 --> 01:05:46.515
Hey!


01:05:46.689 --> 01:05:48.517
Oh, whoa, whoa...


01:05:51.042 --> 01:05:52.913
No. No, no!


01:05:53.522 --> 01:05:55.220
I'’m almost there!


01:05:58.049 --> 01:05:58.832
Whoa!


01:05:59.006 --> 01:06:00.399
[groaning]


01:06:04.011 --> 01:06:05.578
Sonic!


01:06:12.019 --> 01:06:14.717
[gasps][all yelling, grunting]


01:06:14.891 --> 01:06:15.762
[heavy grunt]


01:06:17.155 --> 01:06:18.460
[yells]


01:06:18.634 --> 01:06:20.985
That was so not worth it!


01:06:21.986 --> 01:06:23.117
Ooh!


01:06:26.251 --> 01:06:27.992
You okay?Yeah. You good?


01:06:28.166 --> 01:06:28.905
Sonic!


01:06:29.080 --> 01:06:30.907
[Tom] Hey.[groaning]


01:06:31.082 --> 01:06:34.302
Sonic, one,
concrete boulder, zero.


01:06:34.476 --> 01:06:35.434
[sighing]


01:06:35.608 --> 01:06:36.913
Thanks for the save.


01:06:37.088 --> 01:06:38.611
Cutting it a little close,
don'’t you think?


01:06:40.047 --> 01:06:41.396
Secure the room!


01:06:43.398 --> 01:06:44.617
She'’s got the key.


01:06:47.359 --> 01:06:48.447
I got an idea.


01:06:57.673 --> 01:06:59.110
Commander Walters.


01:06:59.284 --> 01:07:00.372
Sir.


01:07:00.546 --> 01:07:02.156
You'’re...Still alive?


01:07:02.330 --> 01:07:05.116
I'’ll die before I let that key
fall into the wrong hands.


01:07:05.986 --> 01:07:07.379
Thanks for keeping it safe.


01:07:07.553 --> 01:07:09.033
I'’ll take it from here.


01:07:11.731 --> 01:07:13.559
That'’s an order,
Director Rockwell.


01:07:17.258 --> 01:07:19.913
Now, organize
the reinforcements.


01:07:21.262 --> 01:07:22.350
Yes, sir.


01:07:28.095 --> 01:07:30.315
Guys, guys, I got the key.
I repeat, I got the key.


01:07:30.489 --> 01:07:32.099
Now let'’s get out of here.


01:07:36.321 --> 01:07:38.584
Commander Walters.


01:07:38.758 --> 01:07:40.455
No, no. No. Wait!


01:07:54.730 --> 01:07:56.167
What?


01:07:56.341 --> 01:07:58.865
Tom! Everyone'’s clear!
Come on, let'’s go!


01:07:59.039 --> 01:08:00.910
You. What are you--


01:08:02.608 --> 01:08:03.652
Tom!


01:08:04.784 --> 01:08:06.829
Tom. Tom, what happened?


01:08:07.003 --> 01:08:08.527
Speak to me. Come on.


01:08:08.701 --> 01:08:10.877
Come on,
it'’s gonna be okay.


01:08:11.051 --> 01:08:14.098
Please, please, please get up.
Hey, come on, please wake up.


01:08:14.272 --> 01:08:15.882
Wake up, wake up, come on.


01:08:16.578 --> 01:08:17.971
Wake up, wake up, wake up!


01:08:18.667 --> 01:08:20.104
Maria.


01:08:24.151 --> 01:08:25.848
What did you do?


01:08:28.068 --> 01:08:30.114
What I had to.


01:08:32.768 --> 01:08:34.466
Oh, my God. Tom!


01:08:37.686 --> 01:08:39.384
Help me up, kid.


01:08:39.558 --> 01:08:41.125
[grunting]


01:08:42.213 --> 01:08:43.518
Freeze! Don'’t move!


01:08:43.692 --> 01:08:48.567
Any tricks up your sleeve,
Captain Grandtastic?


01:08:48.741 --> 01:08:50.177
[soldiers grunting]


01:08:52.397 --> 01:08:53.615
[terrified yelp]


01:08:55.313 --> 01:08:57.358
We got what we came for.


01:08:58.098 --> 01:09:00.970
Great job, Shadow.


01:09:01.710 --> 01:09:04.583
We have both keys.


01:09:04.757 --> 01:09:07.542
So where'’s your little
science project?


01:09:08.935 --> 01:09:12.895
It'’s closer than you think,
my boy.


01:09:15.071 --> 01:09:16.595
Welcome...[yelps]


01:09:16.769 --> 01:09:20.120
...to my masterpiece!


01:09:23.036 --> 01:09:24.777
I must hand it to GUN.


01:09:24.951 --> 01:09:28.389
They built her
to my exact specifications.


01:09:28.563 --> 01:09:29.738
It'’s...


01:09:31.392 --> 01:09:32.959
remarkable!


01:09:33.133 --> 01:09:34.352
Mm-hmm.


01:09:34.526 --> 01:09:37.355
Astounding!Yes.


01:09:38.486 --> 01:09:40.619
That'’s my genius grand-genome!


01:09:40.793 --> 01:09:44.405
And I have one more surprise.


01:09:46.886 --> 01:09:50.890
It'’s a new suit!


01:09:54.633 --> 01:09:56.548
[giddy squealing]


01:09:58.114 --> 01:10:00.291
[excited grunting]


01:10:00.465 --> 01:10:01.292
Gee.


01:10:01.466 --> 01:10:03.076
[smooching]


01:10:03.772 --> 01:10:05.818
[grunting]


01:10:20.833 --> 01:10:23.227
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:23.401 --> 01:10:25.490
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:25.664 --> 01:10:28.449
♪ <i>I'’m a chip off</i>
<i>The old block!</i>♪


01:10:28.623 --> 01:10:29.929
[ring tone chiming]


01:10:30.103 --> 01:10:32.018
What do you want, Stone?
I'’m busy.


01:10:32.192 --> 01:10:35.195
Doctor, I have a bad feeling
about this.


01:10:35.369 --> 01:10:38.329
I don'’t think your grandfather'’s
been completely honest with us.


01:10:38.503 --> 01:10:40.200
It was something Shadow said.


01:10:40.983 --> 01:10:42.202
<i>There'’s more to their plan.</i>


01:10:43.638 --> 01:10:46.685
How dare you!


01:10:46.859 --> 01:10:49.644
You have been jealous
of my long-lost grand-Pop-Tart


01:10:49.818 --> 01:10:51.951
since the very beginning!


01:10:52.125 --> 01:10:54.780
I no longer require
your obsequious groveling.


01:10:54.954 --> 01:10:57.435
<i>Consider this your notice</i>
<i>of termination.</i>


01:10:57.609 --> 01:11:01.003
Your letter of reference
will be L for Loser.


01:11:01.177 --> 01:11:03.005
Of course,
I'’ll expect you to stay on


01:11:03.179 --> 01:11:04.659
until you'’ve been
successfully cloned.


01:11:04.833 --> 01:11:08.315
But you and I are done!


01:11:08.489 --> 01:11:10.926
Like a blackened
catfish dinner!


01:11:11.100 --> 01:11:14.365
Sir, it'’s too dangerous and
I'’m not there to protect you.


01:11:14.539 --> 01:11:15.670
I already lost you once! I--


01:11:15.844 --> 01:11:17.977
Unsubscribe.
Blocked and reported.


01:11:19.195 --> 01:11:21.110
[breath shaking]
I can'’t lose you again.


01:11:23.025 --> 01:11:24.636
[sighs]


01:11:27.552 --> 01:11:29.118
Do the honors...


01:11:29.858 --> 01:11:31.033
grandson.


01:11:32.948 --> 01:11:34.254
Here we go.


01:12:00.585 --> 01:12:02.761
[excited chatter]


01:12:37.448 --> 01:12:40.494
[sirens wailing][indistinct radio chatter]


01:13:00.340 --> 01:13:02.516
[siren wails]


01:13:08.522 --> 01:13:10.263
It'’ll be okay, Sonic.


01:13:10.437 --> 01:13:12.091
It'’ll be okay?


01:13:12.265 --> 01:13:14.789
Tom is fighting for his life
and you think it'’ll be okay?


01:13:14.963 --> 01:13:18.184
The fox is simply trying
to comfort you.


01:13:18.358 --> 01:13:20.229
Comfort'’s not
what I need right now.


01:13:20.404 --> 01:13:23.537
I need to stop them.
By any means necessary.


01:13:23.711 --> 01:13:24.886
Wait, you don'’t mean--


01:13:25.060 --> 01:13:27.149
The Master Emerald.


01:13:27.323 --> 01:13:30.501
The Emerald must never be
wielded for vengeance.


01:13:30.675 --> 01:13:31.719
Not ever!


01:13:31.893 --> 01:13:33.547
We swore a sacred oath.


01:13:33.721 --> 01:13:35.680
Don'’t talk to me about oaths.
Not now!


01:13:35.854 --> 01:13:37.725
But you told Tom
using the Emerald


01:13:37.899 --> 01:13:39.335
wasn'’t the right choice.


01:13:39.510 --> 01:13:41.599
Well, now it'’s the only choice.


01:13:41.773 --> 01:13:43.557
And if neither of you
have the guts to help me,


01:13:43.731 --> 01:13:45.167
then I'’ll do it alone.


01:13:45.341 --> 01:13:47.431
But I thought
the three of us were a team.


01:13:47.605 --> 01:13:49.607
I thought that'’s what
made us special.


01:13:49.781 --> 01:13:51.565
I'’m not asking you twice,
Knuckles.


01:13:52.436 --> 01:13:55.264
Where is the Master Emerald?


01:13:57.005 --> 01:14:00.356
Your heart is being consumed
by anger, hedgehog.


01:14:00.531 --> 01:14:03.577
You are in no condition
to make decisions right now.


01:14:03.751 --> 01:14:06.319
I know you'’re upset about Tom.
We all are.


01:14:06.493 --> 01:14:08.190
Last chance.


01:14:08.364 --> 01:14:10.976
Where... is it?


01:14:11.542 --> 01:14:13.065
Don'’t do this.


01:14:19.724 --> 01:14:22.683
Part of our oath
is to trust each other.


01:14:22.857 --> 01:14:25.077
And I must abide
by that promise,


01:14:25.251 --> 01:14:27.558
even if you have chosen
to break it.


01:14:27.732 --> 01:14:29.473
But heed this warning:


01:14:29.647 --> 01:14:32.998
The Master Emerald is guarded
by a fearsome warrior.


01:14:33.172 --> 01:14:35.348
And to seize
this ultimate power,


01:14:35.522 --> 01:14:37.437
you will have to go...


01:14:37.611 --> 01:14:39.657
through him.


01:14:39.831 --> 01:14:40.962
[exhales deeply]


01:14:41.136 --> 01:14:43.748
Okay, Wade...
all comes down to this.


01:14:44.488 --> 01:14:46.141
Last few seconds.


01:14:46.315 --> 01:14:47.447
Whipple down the ice.


01:14:47.621 --> 01:14:51.146
He shoots... he scores!


01:14:51.320 --> 01:14:54.367
Wade Whipple
is a champion again!


01:14:54.541 --> 01:14:55.716
[cackles]


01:15:00.286 --> 01:15:03.463
Oh, hey, Sonic. See my goal?
Pretty sick, right?


01:15:03.637 --> 01:15:05.465
I'’m here for the Emerald.


01:15:05.639 --> 01:15:07.162
Look, Sonic, I'’m sorry.


01:15:07.336 --> 01:15:09.513
I promised to guard this emerald
with my life.


01:15:09.687 --> 01:15:11.515
I will do whatever it takes--


01:15:12.646 --> 01:15:13.734
Well, I tried.


01:15:15.649 --> 01:15:17.869
[thunder rumbling]


01:15:19.174 --> 01:15:20.175
[Wade] Sonic!


01:15:24.092 --> 01:15:25.093
Too bright!


01:15:28.706 --> 01:15:31.752
[woman] <i>This is an urgent </i>
<i>national emergency broadcast.</i>


01:15:31.926 --> 01:15:34.363
<i>A spacecraft designed</i>
<i>by the agency GUN</i>


01:15:34.538 --> 01:15:37.453
<i>has been hijacked and launched </i>
<i>out of the River Thames.</i>


01:15:37.628 --> 01:15:41.240
[man broadcasting in Japanese]


01:15:43.242 --> 01:15:46.288
[man] <i>All residents are urged </i>
<i>to seek immediate shelter.</i>


01:16:08.354 --> 01:16:10.617
[Gerald] It'’s time, Shadow.


01:16:12.271 --> 01:16:16.362
Professor, is this really
what Maria would have wanted?


01:16:19.147 --> 01:16:22.498
The question isn'’t
what Maria would have wanted.


01:16:23.630 --> 01:16:25.632
It'’s what do they deserve.


01:16:26.633 --> 01:16:29.114
Remember what she meant to us.


01:16:30.985 --> 01:16:33.901
Remember what they took from us.


01:16:44.346 --> 01:16:45.391
[Gerald] Kids!


01:16:45.565 --> 01:16:47.480
We have to go, now!


01:16:47.654 --> 01:16:49.264
[Maria panting]


01:16:52.703 --> 01:16:55.140
[Gerald] They want to take
Shadow away from us, Maria!


01:16:59.971 --> 01:17:01.146
[weapons charging]


01:17:03.757 --> 01:17:06.455
Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Those are children.


01:17:06.630 --> 01:17:08.414
We'’ve got our orders, Walters!Stand down!


01:17:10.068 --> 01:17:11.939
[gasps]


01:17:19.817 --> 01:17:21.819
[muffled rumbling]


01:17:23.211 --> 01:17:24.430
[high-pitched whistling]


01:17:24.604 --> 01:17:26.345
[groaning]


01:17:32.264 --> 01:17:33.482
Huh?


01:17:35.049 --> 01:17:36.137
Maria!


01:18:09.867 --> 01:18:11.259
[angry roar]


01:18:11.912 --> 01:18:13.697
[panting heavily]


01:18:23.619 --> 01:18:26.622
Excuse me,
Grand Paso Doble.


01:18:26.797 --> 01:18:29.756
What is that thermonuclear
gerbil doing?


01:18:29.930 --> 01:18:32.280
[Gerald] Infusing the core...


01:18:32.454 --> 01:18:33.934
with chaos energy.


01:18:34.108 --> 01:18:36.720
That'’s my little secret.


01:18:36.894 --> 01:18:39.505
The Eclipse Cannon
is about to turn this planet


01:18:39.679 --> 01:18:42.464
into a flaming pile
of rubble,


01:18:42.638 --> 01:18:47.469
wiping out everything
in a 25,000-mile radius.


01:18:50.646 --> 01:18:52.823
Including us.


01:18:56.740 --> 01:18:58.002
What?


01:18:58.916 --> 01:19:02.006
We can'’t annihilate
the Earth!


01:19:02.180 --> 01:19:06.619
Hmm?By combining our genius,
we can rule humanity.


01:19:06.793 --> 01:19:07.707
Together!


01:19:07.881 --> 01:19:10.971
Humanity is a failed experiment.


01:19:11.145 --> 01:19:13.365
If anyone should know that,
it'’s you.


01:19:15.106 --> 01:19:18.022
All your life, you'’ve been
rejected by this world.


01:19:18.892 --> 01:19:20.546
You have nothing down there.


01:19:22.156 --> 01:19:24.202
No one who cares about you.


01:19:25.986 --> 01:19:27.553
But I have you now.


01:19:30.251 --> 01:19:31.644
We'’re family.


01:19:32.558 --> 01:19:34.168
We have each other.


01:19:35.648 --> 01:19:36.910
Oh, Ivo...


01:19:38.738 --> 01:19:40.435
you'’re no Maria.


01:19:43.787 --> 01:19:47.747
The moment I lost her,
my family was gone forever!


01:19:49.401 --> 01:19:51.142
The only way
to give Maria'’s life meaning


01:19:51.316 --> 01:19:53.579
is to destroy the world
that took her from me.


01:19:54.449 --> 01:19:56.582
So I'’m burning it all down!


01:19:59.280 --> 01:20:00.455
It'’s done.


01:20:00.629 --> 01:20:02.936
Good work, Shadow.


01:20:03.110 --> 01:20:04.982
I'’m prepping
the firing sequence.


01:20:05.156 --> 01:20:09.029
The weapon will be fully charged
in ten minutes.


01:20:12.990 --> 01:20:15.079
It'’s almost finished, Maria.


01:20:15.993 --> 01:20:18.343
You will have justice.


01:20:18.517 --> 01:20:20.127
[muffled, distant boom]


01:20:22.738 --> 01:20:24.044
What is that?


01:20:24.958 --> 01:20:27.918
Is GUN launching
missiles at us?


01:20:28.092 --> 01:20:31.138
Impossible.
It'’s moving too fast.


01:20:34.359 --> 01:20:35.882
It'’s him.


01:20:40.234 --> 01:20:41.540
[wind whistling]


01:20:41.714 --> 01:20:43.194
[both grunting]


01:20:44.369 --> 01:20:48.677
You hurt my family.
This ends now!


01:20:48.852 --> 01:20:50.549
Now you know my anger.


01:20:50.723 --> 01:20:53.595
The pain I'’ve felt
for 50 years.


01:20:53.769 --> 01:20:57.034
And you'’ve made
the same choice I did.


01:20:57.208 --> 01:20:58.774
I'’m nothing like you!


01:20:58.949 --> 01:21:00.037
We'’ll see.


01:21:00.211 --> 01:21:02.648
[both yelling]


01:21:07.871 --> 01:21:09.481
Show yourself, coward!


01:21:10.699 --> 01:21:11.875
[grunts]


01:21:13.615 --> 01:21:14.703
[grunts]


01:21:15.530 --> 01:21:16.488
[gasps]


01:21:25.453 --> 01:21:27.673
[screams]


01:21:38.466 --> 01:21:39.728
[shouts]


01:21:39.903 --> 01:21:41.121
[thunder reverberating]


01:21:41.295 --> 01:21:42.949
You were right about one thing.


01:21:43.123 --> 01:21:44.168
[straining]


01:21:44.820 --> 01:21:47.171
This ends now.


01:21:47.867 --> 01:21:50.391
[both grunting]


01:22:13.762 --> 01:22:14.807
What'’s happening?


01:22:14.981 --> 01:22:16.113
Where are they?


01:22:17.157 --> 01:22:18.419
Up there.Where?


01:22:18.593 --> 01:22:19.507
Higher.Hmm?


01:22:19.681 --> 01:22:21.074
[shocked gagging]


01:22:21.248 --> 01:22:22.510
Left yourself open.


01:22:22.684 --> 01:22:24.469
Ivo! What are you doing?


01:22:24.643 --> 01:22:26.036
Thwarting your evil plan!


01:22:32.607 --> 01:22:34.522
[both howling in pain]


01:22:36.960 --> 01:22:38.918
Not the mustache!Agreed.


01:22:39.092 --> 01:22:41.790
Let go on three.
One, two, three!


01:22:42.574 --> 01:22:44.054
[whiskers flapping]


01:22:44.228 --> 01:22:45.403
[beeps]


01:22:46.970 --> 01:22:50.234
[mocking]
Oh... a nano-fist.


01:22:50.408 --> 01:22:54.107
I haven'’t seen that
since I hate-watched <i>Green Lantern</i>in 2011.


01:22:54.281 --> 01:22:56.240
I was saving it for Comic-Con.


01:22:56.414 --> 01:22:58.459
But now there won'’t
be a Comic-Con!


01:22:58.633 --> 01:22:59.678
[yells]


01:23:02.376 --> 01:23:03.987
[both grunting]


01:23:12.125 --> 01:23:14.345
[dust settling]


01:23:21.091 --> 01:23:24.137
Why are you alone?
Where are your friends?


01:23:24.311 --> 01:23:25.834
[straining]


01:23:26.009 --> 01:23:28.402
They tried to stop you,
didn'’t they?


01:23:28.576 --> 01:23:30.056
But you came anyway.


01:23:30.230 --> 01:23:32.667
Your anger was too much.


01:23:32.841 --> 01:23:35.583
What kind of hero
abandons his friends


01:23:35.757 --> 01:23:37.803
to pursue revenge?


01:23:37.977 --> 01:23:40.284
Abandons his family!


01:23:40.458 --> 01:23:43.069
Don'’t you dare talk
about my family.


01:23:43.243 --> 01:23:45.985
And here I thought
you cared for them.


01:23:46.159 --> 01:23:49.293
Especially the one...
What'’s his name?


01:23:49.467 --> 01:23:50.685
Tom?


01:23:50.859 --> 01:23:52.861
[angry howl]


01:24:11.184 --> 01:24:12.881
[Sonic yelling][gasps]


01:24:14.796 --> 01:24:16.885
[strained panting]


01:24:17.060 --> 01:24:19.453
Go ahead. Finish it!


01:24:21.151 --> 01:24:23.501
What are you waiting for? Do it!


01:24:23.675 --> 01:24:26.243
[grunting]I'’m right here!


01:24:27.418 --> 01:24:29.550
You didn'’t let your pain
change who you are...


01:24:30.986 --> 01:24:32.031
in here.


01:24:34.120 --> 01:24:35.904
[whimpering sigh]


01:24:40.474 --> 01:24:42.433
This is not who I am.


01:24:43.129 --> 01:24:44.783
What are you doing?


01:24:44.957 --> 01:24:47.829
You won. Take your revenge.


01:24:49.701 --> 01:24:51.833
There are no winners
with revenge.


01:25:05.151 --> 01:25:06.892
[Maria] <i>Wow.</i>


01:25:07.066 --> 01:25:08.502
[voice echoing]
Look at all those stars.


01:25:09.982 --> 01:25:11.592
<i>They'’re like diamonds.</i>


01:25:13.855 --> 01:25:17.207
The last time I sat
beneath stars like this...


01:25:19.209 --> 01:25:20.775
I was with her.


01:25:22.342 --> 01:25:24.866
I'’ve felt this pain for so long.


01:25:26.564 --> 01:25:28.261
It'’s all I know.


01:25:28.435 --> 01:25:30.655
When I lost Longclaw...


01:25:30.829 --> 01:25:32.526
I felt the same way.


01:25:34.311 --> 01:25:36.748
Did your pain eventually
go away?


01:25:36.922 --> 01:25:38.880
No.


01:25:39.054 --> 01:25:40.969
But in time,
I learned there'’s something


01:25:41.144 --> 01:25:43.450
even more powerful than pain.


01:25:43.624 --> 01:25:45.713
The love we felt for each other.


01:25:46.932 --> 01:25:48.760
That'’s what you need
to hold on to, Shadow.


01:25:48.934 --> 01:25:51.154
Maria might be gone,


01:25:51.328 --> 01:25:53.330
but your love
will always remain.


01:26:07.996 --> 01:26:12.000
"The light shines
even though the star is gone."


01:26:17.092 --> 01:26:19.007
[cannon rumbling in distance]


01:26:23.838 --> 01:26:25.753
This whole mess
is my fault.


01:26:25.927 --> 01:26:28.756
I'’ve been so blinded by rage,
I thought...


01:26:29.453 --> 01:26:31.237
I had no choice.


01:26:34.762 --> 01:26:37.156
You always have a choice.


01:26:42.117 --> 01:26:44.859
But making the right one
is never easy.


01:26:45.033 --> 01:26:46.731
One more thing I learned


01:26:46.905 --> 01:26:49.690
is that when you
really screw something up,


01:26:49.864 --> 01:26:51.344
you can'’t fix it
on your own.


01:26:51.518 --> 01:26:53.738
["Live and Learn"
by Crush 40 playing]


01:27:06.533 --> 01:27:08.187
Gotta go fast.


01:27:08.361 --> 01:27:10.711
Don'’t tell me you'’ve
got a catchphrase.


01:27:10.885 --> 01:27:14.237
That'’s right, new hedgehog.
And everyone loves it.


01:27:29.991 --> 01:27:33.168
I... will... not... try...[grunting]


01:27:33.343 --> 01:27:36.302
...to stop... my...
elders... from...


01:27:36.476 --> 01:27:38.870
destroying... the... world!


01:27:39.697 --> 01:27:40.915
[screams]


01:27:44.528 --> 01:27:46.443
Playtime is over.


01:27:55.147 --> 01:27:57.367
There'’s no going back now.


01:27:57.541 --> 01:28:00.500
[wheezing grunts]


01:28:01.545 --> 01:28:03.895
Set up defense.


01:28:05.853 --> 01:28:07.159
Damn you, autocorrect!


01:28:07.333 --> 01:28:08.595
[attacking grunt]


01:28:11.250 --> 01:28:12.338
[shouts]


01:28:13.034 --> 01:28:14.079
Mantis!


01:28:16.037 --> 01:28:17.300
Oh!


01:28:19.389 --> 01:28:20.520
[cackles]


01:28:20.694 --> 01:28:21.782
Whee!


01:28:22.566 --> 01:28:23.697
[hissing growl]


01:28:23.871 --> 01:28:26.483
I'’m right here,
arach-nerd.


01:28:27.222 --> 01:28:28.049
[shouts]


01:28:28.223 --> 01:28:30.965
[both grunting]


01:28:33.664 --> 01:28:36.797
[cackles]


01:28:36.971 --> 01:28:39.713
That'’s what I call
mantis-scaping.


01:28:39.887 --> 01:28:42.325
That'’s elder abuse!


01:28:45.937 --> 01:28:48.243
[exclaims]


01:28:48.418 --> 01:28:51.638
[female computer voice]
<i>Alert! Alert! Alert!</i>


01:28:51.812 --> 01:28:53.205
Shadow...


01:28:53.379 --> 01:28:55.990
I see you'’ve chosen betrayal.


01:28:57.165 --> 01:28:59.820
And you were once
so useful to me.


01:29:15.532 --> 01:29:17.708
Ready to recycle
some tin cans?


01:29:17.882 --> 01:29:19.492
Just try to keep up.


01:29:50.784 --> 01:29:52.177
[Robotnik]
Please, Grampsy,


01:29:52.351 --> 01:29:54.092
don'’t do this!


01:29:54.266 --> 01:29:56.355
Sorry, kiddo.


01:29:56.529 --> 01:29:59.750
Bring Your Grandkid to Work Day
is over.


01:29:59.924 --> 01:30:00.968
[device beeping]


01:30:01.142 --> 01:30:03.231
[air whistling]


01:30:03.406 --> 01:30:05.756
[yelping]


01:30:05.930 --> 01:30:07.714
Any last words?


01:30:07.888 --> 01:30:10.587
Just one thing...


01:30:11.588 --> 01:30:13.677
that I never thought I'’d say.


01:30:13.851 --> 01:30:15.330
What is it?


01:30:15.505 --> 01:30:17.985
"I love you"?


01:30:18.638 --> 01:30:19.944
No.


01:30:20.118 --> 01:30:22.033
It was something even better.


01:30:22.207 --> 01:30:24.296
But I'’m not gonna say it
if that'’s the way you'’re gonna be.


01:30:24.470 --> 01:30:26.429
Okay. Bye.


01:30:27.430 --> 01:30:29.432
[screaming]


01:30:33.740 --> 01:30:36.047
[cackling]


01:30:36.221 --> 01:30:37.178
[hissing inhale]


01:30:37.352 --> 01:30:38.397
[happy grunt]


01:30:39.311 --> 01:30:41.182
Grandchildren.


01:30:41.356 --> 01:30:44.969
All the fun
and none of the responsibility.


01:30:47.101 --> 01:30:49.887
Who said life was pointless?


01:30:50.670 --> 01:30:53.586
Huh?Oh, right. You did.


01:30:53.760 --> 01:30:54.935
[growls][electricity buzzes]


01:30:55.109 --> 01:30:56.720
[screams]


01:30:57.938 --> 01:30:59.244
[faint zap]


01:30:59.418 --> 01:31:00.941
[Tails, Knuckles cheering][Knuckles] Victory!


01:31:01.115 --> 01:31:03.466
Say what you want
about my granddad,


01:31:03.640 --> 01:31:05.468
he made one
hell of a bug zapper.


01:31:06.294 --> 01:31:07.513
[groans softly]


01:31:07.687 --> 01:31:09.515
We got to stop that laser!


01:31:09.689 --> 01:31:11.909
I knew there was something
I was forgetting.


01:31:22.485 --> 01:31:25.662
We'’re out of time.
The cannon is about to fire!


01:31:25.836 --> 01:31:27.054
Where are you?


01:31:27.228 --> 01:31:29.753
Oh, you know,
just making friends.


01:31:29.927 --> 01:31:31.624
They'’re all yours.


01:31:35.236 --> 01:31:36.890
[laughing]


01:31:40.328 --> 01:31:41.852
[Sonic] Follow me!


01:31:47.945 --> 01:31:50.513
Now, this might hurt a little!


01:31:51.731 --> 01:31:53.951
[all exclaiming]


01:32:04.352 --> 01:32:07.138
So this was your plan?


01:32:07.312 --> 01:32:08.835
[straining] Yeah...


01:32:09.009 --> 01:32:12.491
Would someone mind
shutting down the giant death ray?


01:32:14.928 --> 01:32:16.756
We can'’t stop the cannon
from firing...


01:32:16.930 --> 01:32:19.019
But we can steer it away
from the Earth.


01:32:19.193 --> 01:32:21.544
Coming around to starboard.Aye-aye, Doc.


01:32:25.504 --> 01:32:27.550
Here we go.


01:32:28.768 --> 01:32:30.596
[Tails grunting][Robotnik] It'’s a little tight.


01:32:31.379 --> 01:32:33.599
Definitely not power steering.


01:32:39.518 --> 01:32:42.434
Keep... turning.[straining]


01:32:45.045 --> 01:32:46.873
Jump in anytime here, guys!


01:32:47.047 --> 01:32:48.179
[all straining]


01:32:48.353 --> 01:32:49.833
[steady beeping]


01:32:52.531 --> 01:32:56.361
Can'’t... hold... much... longer.


01:32:56.535 --> 01:32:58.493
[all yelling]


01:33:00.408 --> 01:33:02.236
[exhausted groan]


01:33:05.675 --> 01:33:07.285
[groans]


01:33:13.987 --> 01:33:15.119
Yes![cheering]


01:33:15.293 --> 01:33:17.556
I did it! I did it!


01:33:20.864 --> 01:33:22.561
Oh!Ooh!


01:33:23.214 --> 01:33:24.345
Look what you did!


01:33:24.519 --> 01:33:27.131
Hey, look down there!Sonic!


01:33:33.224 --> 01:33:35.313
Oh, Knuckles,
please tell me you have a--


01:33:35.487 --> 01:33:37.184
Last one.


01:33:37.358 --> 01:33:38.751
Let'’s make it count.


01:33:41.319 --> 01:33:43.364
Ready for a little base of ball?


01:33:44.409 --> 01:33:46.019
Deep breath.


01:33:46.193 --> 01:33:48.892
One... two... three!


01:33:49.936 --> 01:33:52.417
[Knuckles grunting]


01:33:52.591 --> 01:33:53.984
[yells]


01:34:09.260 --> 01:34:10.565
[shocked yell]


01:34:10.740 --> 01:34:12.872
Really!What'’s happening?


01:34:13.046 --> 01:34:15.527
The reactor core is overloading.


01:34:15.701 --> 01:34:18.051
It'’s only a matter of time
before it blows.


01:34:18.225 --> 01:34:19.966
So what does that mean
for Earth?


01:34:20.140 --> 01:34:22.795
A radioactive atmosphere.


01:34:22.969 --> 01:34:25.450
Rain that kills the crops
and melts your flesh.


01:34:25.624 --> 01:34:26.886
Other than that...


01:34:27.060 --> 01:34:28.714
We'’re not done here!


01:34:28.888 --> 01:34:30.803
You try to stabilize
the reactor.


01:34:30.977 --> 01:34:32.196
Buy me some time.


01:34:32.370 --> 01:34:34.415
I'’ll push the station
away from Earth


01:34:34.589 --> 01:34:36.026
before it explodes.


01:34:36.200 --> 01:34:40.204
This is our last chance
to do the right thing.


01:34:41.858 --> 01:34:44.469
[in Spanish]
Go with God


01:34:44.643 --> 01:34:46.863
stinking hedgehog.


01:34:48.125 --> 01:34:50.431
[female computer voice]
<i>Core integrity failing.</i>


01:34:59.614 --> 01:35:01.268
I'’ve got you, Sonic!


01:35:03.270 --> 01:35:04.445
[gasps]


01:35:04.619 --> 01:35:06.230
[moans]


01:35:12.889 --> 01:35:14.325
[straining]


01:35:34.606 --> 01:35:38.001
[computer] <i>Initializing</i>
<i>reactor core stabilizers.</i>


01:35:56.715 --> 01:35:59.413
This is Doctor Ivo Robotnik,


01:35:59.587 --> 01:36:02.329
dedicating my final livestream


01:36:02.503 --> 01:36:05.245
to one very special henchman:


01:36:05.855 --> 01:36:07.247
<i>Agent Stone.</i>


01:36:07.421 --> 01:36:09.641
No, no. Doctor, wait!


01:36:09.815 --> 01:36:12.209
<i>If I can'’t</i>
<i>rule the world...</i>


01:36:13.210 --> 01:36:15.038
I might as well save it...


01:36:15.212 --> 01:36:18.345
for the one and only person
who ever cared about me.


01:36:18.519 --> 01:36:20.434
Don'’t do this, Doctor, please!


01:36:20.608 --> 01:36:24.221
Stone, you were more
than a sycophant to me.


01:36:27.093 --> 01:36:28.355
You were...


01:36:29.835 --> 01:36:31.358
a syco-friend.


01:36:36.929 --> 01:36:40.454
I'’ll miss your lattes
with steamed Austrian goat milk.


01:36:42.413 --> 01:36:44.284
I love the way you make '’em!


01:37:27.371 --> 01:37:31.201
So... I guess there'’s
only one thing left to say.


01:37:31.984 --> 01:37:34.421
[mimics robotic servos]


01:37:35.988 --> 01:37:37.468
It'’s been a real drag.


01:37:38.164 --> 01:37:39.644
Thanks for nothing.


01:37:51.830 --> 01:37:53.440
[birds chirping faintly]


01:37:55.399 --> 01:37:56.966
[coughing]


01:37:58.228 --> 01:37:59.403
Sonic, look.


01:38:09.630 --> 01:38:11.502
Shadow and Robotnik.


01:38:11.676 --> 01:38:13.896
They sacrificed
themselves...


01:38:14.070 --> 01:38:16.072
to save everyone.


01:38:16.811 --> 01:38:18.857
You always have a choice.


01:38:20.119 --> 01:38:22.861
Guys, I'’m really sorry
for running off like that.


01:38:23.035 --> 01:38:24.645
I shouldn'’t have
left you behind.


01:38:26.430 --> 01:38:28.040
The truth is...


01:38:28.214 --> 01:38:30.869
you'’re the best teammates
a hedgehog could ever ask for.


01:38:32.610 --> 01:38:34.438
And the best friends.


01:38:34.612 --> 01:38:36.483
Can you ever forgive me?


01:38:40.574 --> 01:38:42.359
Team Sonic?


01:38:46.450 --> 01:38:49.061
[Sonic]
How about just "team"?


01:38:57.374 --> 01:38:58.984
Goodbye, Doctor.


01:39:15.522 --> 01:39:17.829
[Sonic] Big finish.[Knuckles] Mmm!


01:39:19.352 --> 01:39:21.789
Now that'’s
what I call teamwork.


01:39:21.964 --> 01:39:23.748
Okay! It'’s ready!


01:39:23.922 --> 01:39:25.402
[munching]


01:39:25.576 --> 01:39:26.751
[gasps]


01:39:26.925 --> 01:39:28.579
Knuckles,
how could you?


01:39:28.753 --> 01:39:30.581
Gotta be faster than that!


01:39:31.495 --> 01:39:32.583
Give me a break.


01:39:32.757 --> 01:39:34.063
Still moving a little slow
over here.


01:39:34.237 --> 01:39:36.021
Donut Lord!Yay!


01:39:36.195 --> 01:39:37.718
[pained groan]


01:39:37.892 --> 01:39:40.547
Okay, Knuckles, that'’s...I am having the love.


01:39:40.721 --> 01:39:42.071
[barks]
I want the love!


01:39:42.245 --> 01:39:44.943
[Tails] Aww...Get in here, Ozzy.


01:39:45.117 --> 01:39:46.814
It'’s great
to be back together.


01:39:46.989 --> 01:39:48.816
We'’re stronger than ever.


01:39:48.991 --> 01:39:51.428
And nothing is gonna
stand in our way.


01:39:52.777 --> 01:39:56.607
Except that one piece
of unfinished business.


01:40:05.659 --> 01:40:08.662
And way out in front, to the
surprise of absolutely no one,


01:40:08.836 --> 01:40:10.012
it'’s the Blue Blur!


01:40:10.186 --> 01:40:11.926
Often imitated,
never duplicated,


01:40:12.101 --> 01:40:13.319
the one, the only...


01:40:13.493 --> 01:40:14.233
[yells]


01:40:14.407 --> 01:40:15.887
Let'’s do this!


01:40:16.061 --> 01:40:18.237
Yeah! [laughs]


01:40:18.411 --> 01:40:21.501
[yells]All right, boys,
try and keep up.


01:40:22.198 --> 01:40:24.069
[all cheering, whooping]


01:40:28.595 --> 01:40:31.598
["Run It"
by Jelly Roll playing]


01:42:17.922 --> 01:42:21.447
Sonic the Hedgehog
is Family Champion once again!


01:42:22.100 --> 01:42:23.145
Tails?


01:42:23.710 --> 01:42:25.234
Knuckles?


01:42:26.887 --> 01:42:29.847
Okay. Yeah, I overshot
the finish line.


01:42:33.764 --> 01:42:35.244
[electronic whirring]


01:42:38.769 --> 01:42:41.772
[Sonic] Okay,
so how do I get back?


01:42:44.296 --> 01:42:46.037
[weapon powering up]


01:42:46.820 --> 01:42:48.822
[beeping]


01:42:53.175 --> 01:42:54.263
[Sonic] Pro tip:


01:42:54.437 --> 01:42:55.655
If you'’re gonna take a shot


01:42:55.829 --> 01:42:57.962
at the fastest creature
in the universe...


01:43:00.312 --> 01:43:01.922
you'’d better not miss.


01:43:05.752 --> 01:43:08.364
Um... I'’m flattered
by the cosplay,


01:43:08.538 --> 01:43:10.235
but you got
a few details wrong.


01:43:10.409 --> 01:43:13.282
I can'’t blame you, though.
It'’s hard to copy perfection.


01:43:23.379 --> 01:43:25.381
That'’s a neat trick.


01:43:33.998 --> 01:43:35.217
[Sonic yelps]


01:43:37.306 --> 01:43:39.221
What? Who are you?

